# 050 · A docs site, and a two-command start

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.5.0](../roadmap.md#v050)

## What

The docs as a website, with a settings reference built from the code. `thermite init`, `up`, `down`, `status` and `demo` start and run Thermite from the published images.

## Why

A docs site is easier to search, and two commands are easier than a compose file.

## Done when

- [ ] The site builds in CI and is published.
- [ ] `thermite init && thermite up` gives a running control and rig.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

